{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "John in Mexico"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Life on the Peninsula"}, {"type": "position", "content": 3}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Celebrating Important Occasions > Day of the Dead"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 12}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about travel and vacations in social situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le12ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking About Daily Routines"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Daily routines are things you do every day."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you talk about daily routines, you use the Present tense and a preposition of time like <span class=\"strong\">at, until, by</span> and <span class=\"strong\">from\u2026 to</span>.  <br/><br/>You use expressions of time like <span class=\"strong\">On Saturdays...</span> to say that you do things on a regular basis."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Preposition or<br/> Expression of Time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Use\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"at\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a specific time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wake up at 7:00 a.m.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"until\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a period of time leading up to a specific time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm in class until 3:00 in the afternoon. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"in\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"in or during a period of time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I read the newspaper in the morning.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"from....to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the beginning and ending time of an activity\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I have classes from 9:00 to 3:00 every day.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"on (Sundays)...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"on the same day of the week  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I don't work on Sundays.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Should, Could, Have to, Must"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Should, could, might and have to and must are modals. "}, {"type": "example", "content": " I should go to the gym for an hour after work."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">should, could</span> and <span class=\"italic\">might</span> to give advice, show possibility or expectation, or make a suggestion.  <br/>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">have to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">must</span> to show necessity. <br/>The modals are followed by a verb in the base form. The verb does not change."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I could go for a jog before work."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I must wake up early. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Sometimes I have to buy ingredients or research new recipes in the afternoon. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "routine "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a series of things you do in a similar way each time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Do you have a routine on the cruise ship?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le12ob03aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about daily routines."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "activity "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something that someone does; an interest"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like to do activities when we're at port."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le12ob03aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hour "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "60 minutes"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I should go to the gym for an hour after work."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le12ob03aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to wake up "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to stop sleeping"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I must wake up early to get to class in time."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le12ob03aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "morning"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "time of the day from around 5:00 - 12:00 a.m."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I get up around 8:00 and have a light breakfast in the morning. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le12ob03aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "afternoon "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "time of the day from around 12:00 - 6:00 p.m."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Sometimes I have to buy ingredients or look up new recipes in the afternoon."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le12ob03aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "port "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the place where a cruise ship stops"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I sometimes do activities when we're at port. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le12ob03aud05"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Work with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Choose a famous person your partner may know. Don't tell your partner who it is."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Invent a daily routine for this person. The routines can be funny and creative. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 5 sentences, like <span class=\"italic\">\u201cIn the morning, I ...\u201d</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Put clues into the daily routine to help your partner guess who it is."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask your partner to guess who it is."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Change roles and repeat."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write about daily routines."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use expressions of time."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make predictions."}]}], "labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le12ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le12ob03re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn4le12ob03re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hi, John. How's it going on the cruise ship? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Great! How are you? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm good. Do you have a routine?", "id": 1, "time": "0100", "image": "engenn4le12ob03re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>:  I get up around 8:00 and have a light breakfast in the morning. I might read the newspaper, or I could go for a jog before work.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Sounds nice.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>:  I have lunch in the cafeteria at noon. Then, I check my e-mail. I should go the gym for an hour after work, but I sometimes do activities when we're at port. How is San Francisco?", "id": 2, "time": "7000", "image": "engenn4le12ob03re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: School is fun, but I must wake up early. Classes start at 9. Sometimes I have to buy ingredients or research new recipes in the afternoon. In the evening, I often talk on the phone.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>:  Ah, life as a student!", "id": 3, "time": "29000", "image": "engenn4le12ob03re2img01.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le12ob03re6aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le12ob03re6img01.jpg", "images": []}}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Listening"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Vocabulary and Grammar"}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about daily routines.  "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can express necessity or obligation.  "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can express possibility and expectation."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Do you have a routine? What is it like?  "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Which of these daily actions are unmissable? Which are optional?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "We all have a daily routine. What is yours?"}], "template_override": 1}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"ty